# This repository tracks only coordination files located directly at its root.
#
# Every immediate child directory is an independent repository, experiment,
# local-only workspace, generated tree, or archive. The parent repository must
# treat those directories as opaque and must never recursively stage them.
/*/

# The versioned GitHub Pages runtime is the one deliberate child directory:
# index.html owns the public API while versioned WASM and source artifacts are
# fetched lazily from site/v3/. Older versions remain additive history. All
# project/workspace directories remain opaque.
!/site/
/site/programs/*/versions/.building-*/

# engine_toy is a real, versioned simulation project (not a throwaway
# experiment), so it is tracked here directly rather than as an opaque
# child directory.
!/engine_toy/

# Archive/quarantine names are called out explicitly for human readers. These
# rules are redundant with /*/ at the root, but document the safety boundary.
/_quarantine/
/archive/
/archives/

# Root-local machine and editor debris. Add individual root files here only
# when they should never be part of the coordination repository.
/*.log
/*.tmp
/*.bak
/*.zip
/.DS_Store
/Thumbs.db

# engine_toy generates three kinds of file that are not source and must
# not be tracked. They were committed once, in 8387de4, before these
# rules existed.
#
#   RENDERS AND LOGS. Every trial and reference script writes a PNG or
#   an animated PNG beside itself, and the live windows write run logs.
#   They are outputs of the scripts that are tracked, reproducible by
#   running them, and they were 73 files in one commit.
/engine_toy/*.png
/engine_toy/*.log

#   BAKED NATIVE ARTIFACTS. `structure_native` and `interior_ballistics`
#   build into baked/<law>_<digest>/ and the digest IS the identity:
#   same generated source, same machine code. Tracking the DLL, LIB, LL
#   and PDB puts megabytes of build output in history to say something
#   the source already says, and a stale one is worse than none because
#   the cache is keyed to rebuild only when the digest changes.
/engine_toy/baked/

#   EDITOR BACKUPS.
/engine_toy/*.bak
/engine_toy/*.bak2
